<title>PHILIPPINES: Mabuhay Vinyl declares 20 pct stock div.</title>
<headline>Mabuhay Vinyl declares 20 pct stock div.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mabuhay Vinyl Corp said on Wednesday its board declared a 20 percent stock dividend to stockholders on record as of May 16, 1997.</p>
<p>The dividend declaration will be submitted to stockholders for approval on April 24, the company said. The dividend is expected to be paid on June 23, 1997.</p>
<p>Mabuhay Vinyl made its debut at the Philippine Stock Exchange on February 5 this year. It is a manufacturer of caustic soda and polyvinyl chloride resin.</p>
<p>--Manila newsroom (632) 841-8937</p>
</text>
